flowchart TD
    U[Travel request] --> M[Planner Manager]
    M --> F[Flight Worker]
    M --> H[Hotel Worker]
    M --> A[Activity Worker]
    F --> S[(Shared TripState)]
    H --> S
    A --> S
    M --> S
    F --> B[Budget Worker: gate]
    H --> B
    A --> B
    B <--> S
    B -->|Rejected: ask for cheaper options| M
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| F
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| H
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| A
    S --> I[Day-by-day itinerary + trace]
    S --> L[Append-only JSONL run log]
